  "summary": "Professional Experience:\n     Student at PTI in the multimedia program using Adobe applications to create and develope web sites. I am also a Tutor/Lab assistant at PTI, so I have experiance with instructing others. I am interested in developing and designing websites in HTML as well as Flash.\n\nGoals:\n     I would like to be an effective web designer/developer. Eventually I would like to do freelance work, but until that time I would like to be a part of a small company doing site designing and coding.\n\nSpecialties: Related Course work\n\n3D Modeling and Animation \nServer Side Scripting \nClient Side Scripting \nDigital Imaging \nComputer Illustration \nInteractive Design \nAudio/Video Editing \nDynamic Content Management \n\nComputer Knowledge:\n\nAdobe Photoshop \nAdobe Illustrator \nAdobe Flash \nAdobe Dreamweaver \n3D Studio Max \nMySQL \nXML \nHTML \nJava \nPHP",
